# HSH(1)

## NAME

hsh - Simple POSIX-compliant command interpreter

## SYNOPSIS
sh [options]

## DESCRIPTION
hsh is a simplified version of a POSIX-compliant command interpreter (shell). It is implemented by compiling the files found in [Holberton Simple Shell Repository](https://github.com/DziRare/holbertonschool-simple_shell). Must be compilited in a valid UNIX-like shell.

